Third-party source
==================

The JSystem sources under src/JSystem/ and the headers under include/JSystem/,
include/dolphin/, include/std/, include/types.h, include/macros.h,
include/mathHelper.h and libs/PowerPC_EABI_Support/include/ were imported
from the Mario Kart: Double Dash!! decompilation project
(https://github.com/doldecomp/mkdd), which is released under CC0 1.0
Universal. Many thanks to its contributors.

FSA's JSystem was built with MWCC GC/2.6 at -O4,p; these files are used
unmodified unless noted in git history.

SDK/MSL/Runtime/MetroTRK sources (src/dolphin, src/MSL_C, src/Runtime.PPCEABI.H, src/TRK_MINNOW_DOLPHIN) and include/sdk: Pikmin 2 decomp, https://github.com/projectPiki/pikmin2
SDK function identification and MSL signal.c: Mario Kart: Double Dash!! decomp, https://github.com/doldecomp/mkdd
SDK function identification and ported functions (GXDraw, GXAttr getters, GXTransform, GXFifo, vec): Dolphin SDK 2004 decomp, https://github.com/doldecomp/dolsdk2004
GBA library identification (reference objects only): The Wind Waker decomp, https://github.com/zeldaret/tww
